{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happens after you die?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the afterlife, if there even is one?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You go into the light and...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">find out it's playing cards with a skeleton man. Well, it is for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hogen</strong> is a <strong>digital card game</strong> drawing inspiration from Gwent and Magic: the Gathering. Place weapon, unit, and magical crystal shard cards to activate abilities and overpower your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can be played with just a mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel a story of Life and Death as progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/life.png?t=1743620428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play against vibrant and animated boards with custom dynamic music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/waterLevel.png?t=1743620428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cards and build your own deck to grow your power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/airLevel.png?t=1743620428\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's time to duel!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3575520/4e71d2e8fe765d8d3dcb9c00c54d25bb6ecc9c89.jpg"},{"name":"Booster Pack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3575520/12fb022c18e031b8890010b9e04e52d0e6a1171e.jpg"},{"name":"Learning Liquids","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3575520/2e4cad49e560909e63c3489b46d6311540aa2fa7.jpg"},{"name":"Studying Solids","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamc